| `PATCH /messages/{message_id}` | Edits a message. | `{content}` -> updated message. |
| `DELETE /messages/{message_id}` | Deletes a message. | None -> confirmation. |
| `POST /messages/{message_id}/forward` | Forwards a message. | `{conversation_id}` or `{to_conversation_id}` -> forwarded message. |
| `POST /messages/{message_id}/delivered` | Marks a message delivered. | None -> confirmation. |
| `POST /messages/conversations/{conversation_id}/read` | Marks messages in a conversation read. | Query `up_to_message_id?` -> `{updated}` count. The current implementation marks all unread receipts in that conversation. |
| `POST /messages/{message_id}/reactions` | Adds or changes a reaction. | `{emoji}` -> reaction result. |
| `DELETE /messages/{message_id}/reactions/{emoji}` | Removes your reaction. | None -> confirmation. |

